#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Rose"
msgstr "Rose"

msgid ""
"Rose: a soft music box tune with a rustle of petals. A rose drifting in the "
"Valentine's season, worth 25 more than a heart."
msgstr ""
"Rose : un doux air de boîte à musique avec un froissement de pétales. Une "
"rose qui flotte pendant la saison de la Saint-Valentin, qui vaut 25 de plus "
"qu'un cœur."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a soft music box tune with a rustle of petals. A rose drifting in the "
"Valentine's season, worth 25 more than a heart."
msgstr ""
"un doux air de boîte à musique avec un froissement de pétales. Une rose qui "
"flotte pendant la saison de la Saint-Valentin, qui vaut 25 de plus qu'un "
"cœur."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Golden heart"
msgstr "Cœur d'or"

msgid ""
"Golden heart: a shimmer of tiny bells. Only on Valentine's night, worth 100."
msgstr ""
"Cœur d'or : un miroitement de clochettes. Seulement pendant Nuit de la "
"Saint-Valentin, il vaut 100."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a shimmer of tiny bells. Only on Valentine's night, worth 100."
msgstr ""
"un miroitement de clochettes. Seulement pendant Nuit de la Saint-Valentin, "
"il vaut 100."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Love note"
msgstr "Billet doux"

msgid ""
"Love note: a slow flutter of paper. A folded note drifting slowly. Hit it "
"to keep the note."
msgstr ""
"Billet doux : un lent froissement de papier. Un billet plié qui flotte "
"lentement. Touche-le pour le garder."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a slow flutter of paper. A folded note drifting slowly. Hit it to keep the "
"note."
msgstr ""
"un lent froissement de papier. Un billet plié qui flotte lentement. "
"Touche-le pour le garder."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "String creak"
msgstr "Craquement de corde"

msgid "String creak: the bow drawing, rising as the string comes back."
msgstr ""
"Craquement de corde : l'arc qui se bande, de plus en plus aigu quand la "
"corde recule."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the bow drawing, rising as the string comes back."
msgstr "l'arc qui se bande, de plus en plus aigu quand la corde recule."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Full draw"
msgstr "Arc bandé"

msgid "Full draw: a soft wooden click. Let go now to shoot."
msgstr "Arc bandé : un doux clic de bois. Lâche maintenant pour tirer."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a soft wooden click. Let go now to shoot."
msgstr "un doux clic de bois. Lâche maintenant pour tirer."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Arrow loosed"
msgstr "Flèche tirée"

msgid "Arrow loosed: a twang and a whoosh."
msgstr "Flèche tirée : un twang et un sifflement."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a twang and a whoosh."
msgstr "un twang et un sifflement."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Slack string"
msgstr "Corde molle"

msgid ""
"Slack string: a dull flop. Let go too soon, so the arrow stays in your hand."
msgstr ""
"Corde molle : un plof sourd. Lâché trop tôt, la flèche reste dans ta main."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a dull flop. Let go too soon, so the arrow stays in your hand."
msgstr "un plof sourd. Lâché trop tôt, la flèche reste dans ta main."

msgid "Aim tick: the bow turns one step."
