#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Lamp out"
msgstr "Lampe éteinte"

msgid ""
"Lamp out: a thin whistle of draught across empty glass. It pulses from the "
"wall where a lamp needs lighting, louder as you come near."
msgstr ""
"Lampe éteinte : un mince sifflement de courant d'air sur du verre vide. Il "
"pulse depuis le mur où une lampe attend, plus fort quand tu approches."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a thin whistle of draught across empty glass. It pulses from the wall where "
"a lamp needs lighting, louder as you come near."
msgstr ""
"un mince sifflement de courant d'air sur du verre vide. Il pulse depuis le "
"mur où une lampe attend, plus fort quand tu approches."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Lamp burning"
msgstr "Lampe allumée"

msgid ""
"Lamp burning: the small flutter of a candle flame. You hear it from the "
"wall as you pass a lamp that is lit."
msgstr ""
"Lampe allumée : le petit frémissement d'une flamme de bougie. Tu l'entends "
