msgid ""
"The lamps along the Long Hall have gone out, and Mabel has handed you her "
"old taper to light them again"
msgstr ""
"Les lampes de la Longue Galerie se sont éteintes, et Mabel t'a confié sa "
"vieille chandelle pour les rallumer"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"If it runs out, Mabel lights you a fresh one, so the hall always gets lit."
msgstr ""
"Si elle s'éteint, Mabel t'en allume une neuve, donc la galerie finit "
"toujours allumée."

#. placeholders: {p}
