msgstr "Lance d'abord le boum, avec 1 ou {control_name}."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Listen for the boom and its timing."
msgstr "Écoute le boum et son moment."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The go is time zero."
msgstr "Le départ est le temps zéro."

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} plays the show: three wooden ticks, then a brighter go."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start} joue le spectacle : trois tics de bois, puis un départ "
"plus clair."

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} plays the show: three wooden ticks, then a brighter go. "
"The go is time zero. Listen for the boom and its timing."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start} joue le spectacle : trois tics de bois, puis un départ "
"plus clair. Le départ est le temps zéro. Écoute le boum et son moment."

msgid "The show is over: your turn."
msgstr "Le spectacle est fini : à toi."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"After the go, press 1 to launch a boom at the same delay as in the show."
msgstr ""
"Après le départ, appuie sur 1 pour lancer un boum avec le même délai que "
"dans le spectacle."

#. placeholders: {p}
