#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Swing tone"
msgstr "Son du balancier"

msgid ""
"Swing tone: a hum that rises to the top of the swing, then falls. Let go at "
"the top."
msgstr ""
"Son du balancier : un bourdonnement qui monte jusqu'en haut du balancier, "
"puis redescend. Lâche en haut."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a hum that rises to the top of the swing, then falls. Let go at the top."
msgstr ""
"un bourdonnement qui monte jusqu'en haut du balancier, puis redescend. "
"Lâche en haut."

msgid "Release: a thump as the ball meets the lane."
msgstr "Lâcher : un coup sourd quand la boule touche la piste."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a thump as the ball meets the lane."
msgstr "un coup sourd quand la boule touche la piste."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Rolling ball"
msgstr "Boule qui roule"

msgid ""
"Rolling ball: a low rumble that moves across with the ball and grows louder "
"as it nears the pins."
msgstr ""
"Boule qui roule : un grondement grave qui se déplace avec la boule et "
"grossit en approchant des quilles."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a low rumble that moves across with the ball and grows louder as it nears "
"the pins."
msgstr ""
"un grondement grave qui se déplace avec la boule et grossit en approchant "
"des quilles."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Gutter"
msgstr "Rigole"

msgid ""
"Gutter: a hollow rattle. The ball left the lane and will hit no pins."
msgstr ""
"Rigole : un cliquetis creux. La boule a quitté la piste et ne touchera "
"aucune quille."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a hollow rattle. The ball left the lane and will hit no pins."
msgstr ""
"un cliquetis creux. La boule a quitté la piste et ne touchera aucune quille."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Light clatter"
msgstr "Fracas léger"

msgid "Light clatter: a few pins falling."
msgstr "Fracas léger : quelques quilles qui tombent."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a few pins falling."
msgstr "quelques quilles qui tombent."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Heavy clatter"
msgstr "Fracas lourd"

msgid "Heavy clatter: most of the rack falling at once."
msgstr "Fracas lourd : presque tout le jeu qui tombe d'un coup."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "most of the rack falling at once."
msgstr "presque tout le jeu qui tombe d'un coup."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pinsetter"
msgstr "Requilleur"

msgid ""
"Pinsetter: a mechanical sweep and clunk as the deck is cleared and pins are "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Requilleur : un balayage mécanique et un clonk quand la piste est dégagée "
"et les quilles replacées."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a mechanical sweep and clunk as the deck is cleared and pins are set."
msgstr ""
"un balayage mécanique et un clonk quand la piste est dégagée et les quilles "
"replacées."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Ball return"
msgstr "Retour de boule"

msgid ""
"Ball return: a rolling rumble and a knock. Your ball is back and you can "
"roll."
msgstr ""
"Retour de boule : un roulement et un coup. Ta boule est revenue et tu peux "
"lancer."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a rolling rumble and a knock. Your ball is back and you can roll."
msgstr "un roulement et un coup. Ta boule est revenue et tu peux lancer."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Strike sting"
msgstr "Jingle du strike"

msgid ""
"Strike sting: a short jukebox flourish. All ten pins with the first ball."
msgstr ""
"Jingle du strike : une courte fanfare de juke-box. Les dix quilles avec la "
"première boule."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a short jukebox flourish. All ten pins with the first ball."
msgstr ""
"une courte fanfare de juke-box. Les dix quilles avec la première boule."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Spare bell"
msgstr "Cloche du spare"

msgid "Spare bell: a bright bell. The second ball cleared the rest."
msgstr ""
"Cloche du spare : une cloche claire. La deuxième boule a fait tomber le "
"reste."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a bright bell. The second ball cleared the rest."
msgstr "une cloche claire. La deuxième boule a fait tomber le reste."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pumpkins falling, light"
