msgid "Slow Kettle"
msgstr "Slow Kettle"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same guests: new ones each day, each Monday and each "
"month."
msgstr ""
"Up et Down choisissent un défi, Enter lit son briefing, Escape revient. "
"Tout le monde a les mêmes clients : de nouveaux chaque jour, chaque lundi "
"et chaque mois."

msgid "Challenge cups earn no coins, and your sand timer stays at home."
msgstr ""
"Les tasses de défi ne rapportent aucune pièce, et ton sablier reste à la "
"maison."

msgid "Opening the Slow Kettle challenge."
msgstr "Ouverture du défi Slow Kettle."

