msgid ""
"The village pond at dusk, the snow just starting. Drifts lie here and there."
msgstr ""
"L'étang du village au crépuscule, la neige qui commence. Des congères çà et "
"là."

msgid "the mill pond"
msgstr "l'étang du moulin"

msgid ""
"The mill pond, by the frozen wheel. Thin ice where the stream runs in."
msgstr ""
"L'étang du moulin, près de la roue gelée. De la glace fine là où le "
"ruisseau arrive."

msgid "the long lake"
msgstr "le long lac"

msgid ""
"The long lake, out past the willows. Quicker, and the snow comes harder."
msgstr ""
"Le long lac, au-delà des saules. Plus rapide, et la neige tombe plus fort."

