msgstr ""
"{sentence_start} et {r} font tourner le sous-marin tant que tu les "
"maintiens. Relâche et ton cap est annoncé. Tourne jusqu'à avoir le coffre "
"droit devant, et lance un ping pour vérifier."

msgid "The chest is ahead of you."
msgstr "Le coffre est devant toi."

msgid ""
"Mines warn you when you are near, and touching one costs hull. One lies "
"south of you. Ping to find it."
msgstr ""
"Les mines te préviennent quand tu es près, et en toucher une coûte de la "
"coque. Il y en a une au sud. Lance un ping pour la trouver."

msgid "You found that mine already, the hard way."
msgstr "Tu as déjà trouvé cette mine, à tes dépens."

msgid "That was the mine."
msgstr "C'était la mine."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Swim back to it."
msgstr "Retournes-y."

#. placeholders: {s}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Treasure is safe once you surface at the boat's bell, and {s} says where it "
"is."
msgstr ""
"Le trésor est à l'abri une fois remonté à la cloche du bateau, et {s} dit "
"où elle est."

#. placeholders: {s}
msgid ""
"Treasure is safe once you surface at the boat's bell, and {s} says where it "
"is. Swim back to it."
msgstr ""
"Le trésor est à l'abri une fois remonté à la cloche du bateau, et {s} dit "
"où elle est. Retournes-y."

msgid "At the bell."
msgstr "À la cloche."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Faster uses more air."
msgstr "Plus vite use plus d'air."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Go ahead and swim into the chest."
msgstr "Vas-y, fonce dans le coffre."

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} and {d} move the engine telegraph a step: slow astern, all "
