#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pipe"
msgstr "Tuyau"

msgid ""
"Pipe: a steady, soft organ tone. While you tune, two of these play "
"together, the pipe and its true note. Out of tune, they wobble; in tune, "
"the wobble goes still."
msgstr ""
"Tuyau : un son d'orgue doux et stable. Pendant l'accord, deux de ces sons "
"jouent ensemble, le tuyau et sa note juste. Faux, ils battent ; justes, le "
"battement s'arrête."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a steady, soft organ tone. While you tune, two of these play together, the "
"pipe and its true note. Out of tune, they wobble; in tune, the wobble goes "
"still."
msgstr ""
"un son d'orgue doux et stable. Pendant l'accord, deux de ces sons jouent "
"ensemble, le tuyau et sa note juste. Faux, ils battent ; justes, le "
"battement s'arrête."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Echo note"
msgstr "Note de l'Echo"

msgid ""
"Echo note: one short organ note. The Echo plays these back as a tune once a "
"rank is tuned."
msgstr ""
"Note de l'Echo : une courte note d'orgue. The Echo les rejoue en mélodie "
"une fois la rangée accordée."

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"one short organ note. The Echo plays these back as a tune once a rank is "
